    "description": "The Micron Secure ® TCG Enterprise SSC Self-Encrypting Drive FIPS 140-2 Module is embodied in Micron S650DC SAS SED model solid state drive. These products meet the performance requirements of the most demanding Enterprise applications. The cryptographic module (CM) provides a wide range of cryptographic services using FIPS approved algorithms. Services include hardware-based data encryption (AES-XTS), instantaneous user data disposal with cryptographic erase, independently controlled and protected user data LBA bands and authenticated FW download.",
